WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.300
20 forts of the Sahyadri,

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:04.000
climbed over 5 years.

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:06.767
In the order they were

00:00:06.633 --> 00:00:08.967
climbed: Tikona, Vasota,

00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:11.900
Kalavantin Durga, Bhimashankar

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:14.200
To Bhorgiri, Katraj To

00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:15.000
Sinhgad…

00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:19.067
6 easy, 11 medium, 3 hard. 10

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:20.500
written up.

00:00:20.633 --> 00:00:23.133
The longest: Panhala to

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Pawankhind, 22 hours on foot.

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:29.633
Some take two hours. One took

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.000
22.
